{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"lair_void_rift","model_identifier":"lair_void_rift","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# lair_void_rift\n\nLair: void rift (C6, purple demons, from night 80), 5 m (178 u) high.\n\nA tall, torn opening in the air: a vertical lens-shaped tear 168 u tall and up to 80 u wide hanging 10 u above the ground, black inside with faint violet specks (rift_void_*), its ragged edges glowing violet (glow_edge_*, on rift_edge_r / rift_edge_l), over cracked, frosted ground: a pale frost plate with violet cracks, an inner ring of hoarfrost and ice shards spiking up around it. Footprint 12 x 10 terrain columns (192 x 160 u), centred on the origin, front (entrance) toward -Z.\n\n- Cubes: 54 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -90.0..90.0, y 0.0..188.0, z -70.0..70.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- tear: 84 x 186 x 6 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 2 (blocking); ice shards are decoration\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `pulse` | 4 | loop | slow breathing loop, 4 s: the tear swells to 105 % width at 1.0 s with the edges flaring outward, settles, contracts slightly at 3.0 s |\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_spawn` on `root` at (0, 2, -10)\n- `fx_rift` on `rift` at (0, 94, -3)\n\n## Notes\n\n- `fx_spawn`: ground in front of the tear (demons step out); `fx_rift`: centre of the tear (violet light, particles).\n- Lit cubes: glow_edge_*, glow_tip_*.\n- The tear is two-sided (black on both faces).\n- Destroyed version: `lair_void_rift_destroyed.bbmodel` in this folder (separate file, same footprint).\n"},"description":"# lair_void_rift\n\nLair: void rift (C6, purple demons, from night 80), 5 m (178 u) high.\n\nA tall, torn opening in the air: a vertical lens-shaped tear 168 u tall and up to 80 u wide hanging 10 u above the ground, black inside with faint violet specks (rift_void_*), its ragged edges glowing violet (glow_edge_*, on rift_edge_r / rift_edge_l), over cracked, frosted ground: a pale frost plate with violet cracks, an inner ring of hoarfrost and ice shards spiking up around it. Footprint 12 x 10 terrain columns (192 x 160 u), centred on the origin, front (entrance) toward -Z.\n\n- Cubes: 54 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 64x64, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -90.0..90.0, y 0.0..188.0, z -70.0..70.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- tear: 84 x 186 x 6 (w x h x d) centred on x = 0, z = 0, from y = 2 (blocking); ice shards are decoration\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `pulse` | 4 | loop | slow breathing loop, 4 s: the tear swells to 105 % width at 1.0 s with the edges flaring outward, settles, contracts slightly at 3.0 s |\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `fx_spawn` on `root` at (0, 2, -10)\n- `fx_rift` on `rift` at (0, 94, -3)\n\n## Notes\n\n- `fx_spawn`: ground in front of the tear (demons step out); `fx_rift`: centre of the tear (violet light, particles).\n- Lit cubes: glow_edge_*, glow_tip_*.\n- The tear is two-sided (black on both faces).\n- Destroyed version: `lair_void_rift_destroyed.bbmodel` in this folder (separate file, same footprint).\n","resolution":{"width":256,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"ground_plate","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-90.0,0.0,-70.0],"to":[90.0,1.0,70.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[46,391,226.0,392.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0,396,140.0,397.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0,395,180.0,396.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0,397,140.0,398.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0,0,180.0,140.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv